cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Senvoryn OS Core Contract Specification or reference model in academic or industrial work, please cite it as below."
title: "Senvoryn OS — Core Contract Specification v0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  Senvoryn OS is a proposed clean-sheet operating-system platform built around
  capability-governed authority. This citation covers the Core Contract
  Specification v0.1.0 (document ID SENVORYN-CORE-SPEC-0001), its
  machine-readable schemas and state machines, and the deterministic reference
  SCP decision model. It is a design contract and prototype model, not a
  production operating system, a kernel, a cryptographic implementation, or a
  security certification. The reference model uses simplified trusted primitives
  and must not be deployed as a security boundary.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-15"
license: Apache-2.0
